OL,3,GNEWSAPlanning row erupts in Housing    
OL,4,ASecretary's constituency               
OL,6,FA row over changes to planning rules   
OL,7,Fhas left a Greater Manchester council  
OL,8,Funable to make planning decisions,     
OL,9,Fincluding in Angela Rayner's           
OL,10,Fconstituency.                          
OL,12,FThe Housing Secretary's department has 
OL,13,Fintroduced reforms intended to speed up
OL,14,Fhousebuilding by allowing officers to  
OL,15,Fsign off smaller schemes without       
OL,16,Fcouncillor involvement.                
OL,18,FIn Tameside, which is a Labour-led     
OL,19,Fminority administration, opposition    
OL,20,Fcouncillors have refused to adopt the  
OL,21,Fchanges at successive meetings.        
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
